%description:

TcpCubic.delta:long -- the RTT samples of an epoch longer than the run are ignored.

The claim (TcpCubic.ned): "settling time from the start of each epoch of congestion avoidance
(its first ACK), during which RTT samples are ignored".

The classes: settling (10ms, the default) and long (a time longer than the run), invalid
(below 0). The code: the RTT samples of the first delta of an epoch are ignored
(TcpCubic::processRttSample()); the smallest sample is cubic_delay_min. This test separates "long" from the other value.

Host under test: host1, with TcpCubic and an initial threshold of 8000 bytes, so its epoch of
congestion avoidance starts at once; the round trip is 40 ms until 0.5 s, when an action
shortens it to 4 ms. Observation: level 3, at 1 s, the smallest RTT sample is still about 40 ms: the samples of the epoch are ignored.

%# parameter: TcpCubic.delta
%# class: long
%# value: 100s
%# key: *.host1.tcp.conn-*.algorithm.delta
%# expected-result: PASS

%includes:
#include "ProtocolTest.h"

%global:

using namespace inet;
using namespace inet::protocoltest;

Define_ProtocolTestProgram()
{
    return ProtocolTest("TcpCubicDeltaLong")
        .once(on("host1.tcp").signal("packetSentToLower")
             .filterPacket("tcp.synBit == true && tcp.ackBit == false")
             .capture("isn", "tcp.sequenceNo")
             .describe("the SYN of host1")
             .within(0.5))
        .act(action().at(0.5)
                 .describe("all links get a delay of 1 ms: the round trip falls from 40 ms to 4 ms")
                 .run("tap", [](cModule *tap) {
                     cModule *network = tap->getParentModule();
                     for (cModule *node : {network->getSubmodule("host1"), network->getSubmodule("host2")})
                         node->gate("ethg$o", 0)->getChannel()->par("delay").setValue(cValue(0.001, "s"));
                     for (const char *name : {"a$o", "b$o"})
                         tap->gate(name)->getChannel()->par("delay").setValue(cValue(0.001, "s"));
                 }))
        .act(action().at(1.0)
                 .describe("the smallest RTT sample at 1 s")
                 .assertModule("host1.tcp.conn-*", "state.cubic_delay_min > 0.03"));
}

%activity:
EV << "TcpCubicDeltaLong compiled\n";

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[General]
*.host1.tcp.conn-*.algorithm.delta = 100s    # the parameter under test
*.host1.tcp.tcpAlgorithmClass = "TcpCubic"
*.linkDelay = 10ms
*.host1.tcp.initialSsthresh = 8000
*.host1.app[0].sendBytes = 1000000B
sim-time-limit = 1.5s
include ../../parameter/ini/_bulk.ini
include ../../parameter/ini/_base.ini

%contains: stdout
PROTOCOLTEST TcpCubicDeltaLong: PASS
